{"title": "Community Creator Corner", "pageid": 6437, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Community_Creator_Corner", "categories": [], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Welcome to the Community Creator Corner.\n</p><p><br>\nBelow is a list of content creators that cover <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a> and have helped us with community outreach. Please check them out and help support the BG3 community.\n</p><p><i>These links are not necessarily endorsed by BG3Wiki, and views and opinions expressed by external creators are their own.</i>\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@spellandshield/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Spell&amp;Shield\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@spellandshield/playlists\">Spell&amp;Shield</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"This is a gaming channel with a twist of me, nothing out of the ordinary. Major focus is on RPGs but not exclusively if something catches my fancy. Lots of commentary and some lore videos. Welcome and enjoy the ride!\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@italianspartacus/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"ItalianSpartacus\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@italianspartacus/playlists\">ItalianSpartacus</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"Covering all things Baldur's Gate 3, Total War, Crusader Kings 3, Mount &amp; Blade, Warhammer, Warhammer 40,000, and Age of Sigmar.\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@rpjames8/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"RPJames\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@rpjames8/playlists\">RPJames</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"RPJames is your go to for RPG, Adventure, Open World and the like games news.\"</i> \n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EUTOPIATTV/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"EUTOPIA\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EUTOPIATTV/playlists\">EUTOPIA</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"An aspiring youtuber since I was very young, trying to keep the dream alive.\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@remortisgaming/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Remortis\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@remortisgaming/playlists\">Remortis</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"Just a normal guy who likes to make guides for video games, typically RPGs.\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MrHulthen/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"MrHulthen\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MrHulthen/playlists\">MrHulthen</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"Do you love RPG's? Then this is the place for you.\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@JibunFade/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"JibunFade\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@JibunFade/playlists\">JibunFade</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"Here, you'll find a collection of Walkthroughs, Scenes, Tips &amp; Tricks, Builds and Funny Moments all centered around the latest masterpiece from Larian Studios: Baldur's Gate 3.\"</i> \n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MikkDouble/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"MikkDouble\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MikkDouble/playlists\">MikkDouble</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"Like stupid stuff? Me too. Baldur's Gate 3 funny moments, bugs, clips and more. I mostly enjoy RPGs, CRPGs, MMOs, and plan on making videos on other games as well.\"</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MyUsualMe/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"MyUsualMe\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MyUsualMe/playlists\">MyUsualMe</a></span>\n</p><p><i>\"I'm Joe Usual, a Gen X Gamer. I play primarily Survival Games, RPG's and MMORPG's.\"</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1738/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21699/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2760/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 770350/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.035      1 -total\n 98.83%   22.766      9 Template:Youtube\n 84.94%   19.567      9 Template:Icon_link\n 81.82%   18.847      9 Template:Icon_text\n 65.88%   15.176     18 Template:Trim\n 41.26%    9.504      9 Template:Ifempty\n 15.42%    3.552      9 Template:Icon\n  5.04%    1.161      9 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6437-0!can